    "description": "Once per encounter, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a> to call upon the vengeful spirits of the ancient Sith. Doing so grants you 3 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a> with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vengeful_Spirit_Template\" title=\"Vengeful Spirit Template\">Vengeful Spirit Template</a>. These <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a> appear in any unoccupied square adjacent to you, and last until the end of the encounter (at which point they vanish).",
